Z||000004||hugh||04-25-2001||07:25 AM||||Put the screws in an airtight jar.If nothing falls apart in 2 months.Plant them in your back yard and hope for the best.Use a good fertilizer,like Castrol 5w30 or if you prefer a dry fertilizer you can use ground up fiberglas.I prefer the Castrol myself as it doesn't blow away so easy.  ||||reg||1
